{"name":"Alay","title":"Alay","revision":236745,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Alay","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Alay is an Indonesian subculture that gained prevalence in the mid-2000s to early 2010s, related to a pop culture phenomenon often describing an excessive, tacky (norak) version of Harajuku, Emo, and Jejemon. It is characterized by hyper-expressive, flashy behaviors, overly maximalist aesthetics, and text. The word is a mixture of anak lebay (excessive/hyperbolic) or anak layangan (kite child)."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"It features dramatic posing for social media, expressive selfies, attitude and uses scrambled alternating capitalization of letters (MiXeD cApS) and numbers blended with letters (like h4l0 instead of Halo)."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Glasses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Colored Tees"},{"kind":"list","text":"Headbands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Neckties"},{"kind":"list","text":"Headcaps"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bandana"},{"kind":"list","text":"Emo Fringe"},{"kind":"list","text":"Colored Necklaces/Bracelets"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"list","text":"Kangen"},{"kind":"list","text":"ST12"},{"kind":"list","text":"Radja"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wali"},{"kind":"list","text":"Armada"},{"kind":"list","text":"Silverstein"},{"kind":"list","text":"Escape the Fate"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mozart Season"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/a/a8/9de12dcfb4656121593281adff18cc66.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260813095738","caption":"9de12dcfb4656121593281adff18cc66","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:9de12dcfb4656121593281adff18cc66.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0035-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/49/Screenshot_20260813-180330.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260813100524","caption":"Alay · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Screenshot_20260813-180330.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0035-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}